### subscribe (브라우저 http://localhost:8080 또는 curl -N 권장)
GET http://localhost:8080/sse/subscribe/client-1
Accept: text/event-stream

### send to client
POST http://localhost:8080/sse/send/client-1
Content-Type: text/plain

hello client-1

### broadcast
POST http://localhost:8080/sse/broadcast
Content-Type: text/plain

hello all

### stream (curl -N 권장)
POST http://localhost:8080/sse/stream
Content-Type: text/plain
Accept: text/event-stream

hello streaming response from spring sse

### stream (Flux, curl -N 권장)
POST http://localhost:8080/sse/stream-flux
Content-Type: text/plain
Accept: text/event-stream

hello streaming response from spring sse
